I hope this message finds you in good health and good spirits. You may be surprised to hear from me, but I write with sincerity and kindness in my heart. My name is Malena Arvidsson, I am 39 years old, and I live in Malm?, Sweden.

The reason I am reaching out is simple: I would love to build a friendship across the distance, a pen pal connection where we can share thoughts, laughter, and stories from our lives. I believe that age is only a number, and what truly matters is understanding, respect, and a good sense of humor.

I write with the purest of intentions, hoping this message resonates with you. If you feel the same, I would be delighted to hear back from you. I would be glad to share a photo of myself, and I would enjoy seeing one of you too, if you wish.

With warm regards,

Malena
